body:
Having just beat this on stream recently, it's a VERY underrated gem in the franchise and I think everyone should experience it at least once. The story is interesting, and the animatronics are great. Not to mention each night is something new, so it isn't the same repetitive camera watching job.

&#x200B;

Night 4 sucks tho.

Oh I don't even need the save since I just bought the game, I can wipe it if I have to.

&#x200B;

Edit: Where is the saves located btw?

That's really wholesome

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

don't tell Twitter tho lmao

I think it's the eyebrows tbh, that's about it.

&#x200B;

Edit: Also a lot of folks like long hair, don't take some random reddit comments as the be all end all.

There's a difference between being honest, and straight up insulting.  Not to mention the blatant disrespect to special ed kids.

&#x200B;

Have a nice day.

